<!--
    A card with a tick on it: the queue, finished. Stroked rather than filled, so it reads as an
    illustration inside its tile rather than as another icon of the kind the bars are full of.

    Untinted here. The view that draws it tints it, because the same drawable sits on a coloured
    tile whose foreground is a theme role.
-->
